=====Usage notes=====
It is commonplace in [[Islam]]ic culture to follow mention of the prophet [[Muhammad]]'s name with (SAW) or ([[PBUH]]).

As with PBUH, the use of the abbreviation, rather than the full “sallalahu aleyhi wasallam”, is proscribed by some as lazy and insufficiently respectful; see [[w:PBUH#Ruling on abbreviating the phrase|discussion at Wikipedia]].

